+## Website audience analytics
+
+Stock Value Lens uses GA4 property `558359365` and web stream `16103138730` (measurement ID `G-01JX9HZ5G9`) under the owner's existing Analytics account. Open [the website dashboard](https://analytics.google.com/analytics/web/#/a361772430p558359365/reports/intelligenthome). Reporting uses Europe/Stockholm and USD. User/event retention is two months; reset on new activity is disabled.
+
+`web/analytics.js` loads Google's tag only on `stockvaluelens.com` after a visitor accepts analytics. Rejecting does not affect website features. The footer's Analytics settings lets visitors change their choice; consent expires after 180 days. The privacy page describes data collection. Advertising consent/signals are disabled, enhanced measurement is off, and page/referrer URLs exclude query strings and fragments. Local previews are untracked.
+
+Use GA4 Traffic acquisition for sessions and Pages and screens for page views. These measure consenting traffic from all channels, starting at installation. Search Console measures Google-search clicks; Cloudflare HTTP requests include technical/bot traffic and are not equivalent. Apply an ad network's own required analytics source, metric and period.

